- **Selector keyed to form corpus does not use**: line 43.  
  Input: `plotly.html` containing three copies of `<div class="chart-container"><h4>A</h4><div class="chart-desc">caption</div><svg width="100" height="100"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="3"/></svg></div>`, then `python scripts/figure_audit.py plotly.html`.  
