- **Check can pass while incomplete**: line 218.  
  Input: `python scripts/figure_audit.py --selftest-structure ssot.html`, where `ssot.html` is any recognised SSOT page with 3 figures.  
  Consequence: `zip(("ssot-svg", "plotly"), args)` silently skips the Plotly half and can exit 0 while claiming both renderers were checked.

